{"availability":"available","full":"niranjanxprt/Lexagent","name":"Lexagent","description":"Legal research AI agent: goal → plan → execute → report. Built with FastAPI, Tavily, Langfuse. No agent frameworks.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":6,"forks":0,"created":"2026-02-19T09:14:11Z","updated":"2026-02-22T13:37:14Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://lexagent-production.up.railway.app","topics":["ai-agent","fastapi","langfuse","legal-research","llm","react","streamlit","tavily"],"demo":"https://lexagent-production.up.railway.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:25:22.948Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T21:25:22.948Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T21:25:22.948Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T16:33:37.211Z","stars":6,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T21:25:22.948Z","stars":6,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A legal research AI agent that takes a research goal, breaks it into actionable tasks, executes them using real web search (Tavily), and produces a structured markdown report. You get a plan, stepwise execution with compressed context, and a final report with sources — no framework stack, just a manual agent loop and observability via Langfuse.","Live demo: lexagent-production.up.railway.app | Repo: github.com/niranjanxprt/Lexagent"],"features":["Agent Loop — Built manually (no LangChain, LangGraph, AutoGen, or CrewAI)","Context Compression — Raw search results are never stored; only 2–3 sentence summaries are retained","Langfuse Observability — Full tracing of every LLM call (optional; prompts are in code as fallback if unreachable)","Persistent Sessions — Resume research sessions from past runs","Markdown Reports — Professional legal research reports saved to disk"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/niranjanxprt/Lexagent/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6d1940a41ce061c0b499eb0ad682b92fa2e62ac5d6838b4d01a76267ea5ac45d","extracte